  "proof_construction": "The original real tensor embedding formula is proved bijective on the same literal inverse half-different product-span lattice. The actual inclusion O(E)^N into (B^-1)^N is proved via 1 in B^-1. Source finite-coordinate embedding bijectivity gives a tensor preimage; existing exact integer rank N*[E:Q], real base change and the proved half-embedding cardinality give injectivity. A single actually constructed B works for all prescribed ranks.",
